"migrations are abstracted into the [sbt2-compat](https://github.com/sbt/sbt2-"
"compat) plugin that can be used to avoid creating the shims manually. To use "
"it in your sbt plugin, you can add it to your sbt plugin's `build.sbt`:"
msgstr ""

